  "name": "Balancer V1 BPool single-join rounding drain",
  "summary": "BPool.joinswapPoolAmountOut reverse-computes the single-asset input for a requested BPT output in 18-decimal fixed-point math with no minimum effective input, minimum pool balance, or relative-error check. After flash-loan-funded swaps compress one reserve to dust, the required input rounds down to one base unit while the full BPT amount is minted; the attacker repeated the join and exited pro-rata across eleven Balancer V1 pools within four hours.",
