  "notes": [
    "BPool runtime created by the Balancer factory inside a proxy-driven pool setup transaction. Immutable code with no proxy path; the runtime hashes identically at deployment and immediately before the incident, and the ten sibling pools drained later in the campaign carry the same runtime hash.",
    "Exact pool depletion: for each of the 27 exploit transactions, every pool token's balanceOf(pool) at the block before minus at the block of the transaction, summed per token across the 11 drained BPools (all runtime hash 0x974df1c33872ba8aab782be5117ff348802441590f84ed7701d734bb9c21683e). Flash-loan legs wash inside each transaction and so cancel in the block-boundary deltas. Tokens are priced at the DefiLlama observation nearest before the campaign end; the two Uniswap V2 LP tokens are valued as their share of pair reserves (TWA has no price series, so that pair is taken as twice its WETH side) and wSTA carries no USD value for lack of a price series. SlowMist reported $234,000 for the campaign without publishing a basis."
